<title>GERMANY: W.German prelim May CPI rises 0.4 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>W.German prelim May CPI rises 0.4 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal</p>
<p>Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> PRELIM W.GERMAN INFLATION    May 97	   Apr 97</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct)   +0.4	     -0.2</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr change (pct)	   +1.5	     +1.3</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		  n/a	    115.3</p>
<p>NOTE - The data are provisional. The Statistics Office said it would publish final figures in mid-March.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
